      "role": "user",
      "content": "fair enough. so if the security benefits are mostly speculative or just for investigative use later on, does that mean the privacy trade-offs are basically inevitable and pretty much outweigh the pros? it feels like we're trading actual, guaranteed rights for maybe a slight increase in efficiency.",
